Cell["\<\
If we allow the change of the substrate concentration, the system cannot be \
solved analytically. Therefore, we assume that the supply of substrate is \
large and does not change significantly over the observation time. Moreover, \
we neglect rebinding of the product(s) to the enzyme:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.500807139952928*^9, 3.5008071539753933`*^9}, {
